 src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/497/225/2022-09-18_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\" /></p>\n<h5>&nbsp;</h5>\n<p>Permissions - 自由地使用在你的模组包中。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>点击下方横幅立即取得您的服务器！或前往 <a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\">BisectHosting.com</a> 并确保使用代码 '<strong>gamerpotion</strong>' 以享25折优惠。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/608/745/bisect-banner-large3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"621\" height=\"415\" /></a></p>",
